<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado beheaded six Christians and killed a Catholic priest after a baptism of 175 people, while Mozambican security forces captured six alleged terrorists in Macomia. The United States is considering training Mozambican special forces as Islamic State threatens shipping, and oil prices rose after attacks near Hormuz. Eni will exit the mega Rovuma LNG project to focus on floating liquefaction, removing a major energy investor from the area. There were 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1uTl9INzY4ZUlzUlpINVd6S1lUbVhDVkNaQ01sX3lQWjZwS0hrbWdUZEVQWjJ5U3NNNG1Udm1MOTgwTnQtcV9ZcTFvZGRGanI5enAwN1hZVkd1djFSTXpueWdlRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5nUHJNZG5wNTNoTEJoeXYzWlhhNlIxcXFYclhQQVdKdkJ5d0ExWjBpR1NFRWpkSmQxeHd1dUNTYk1jaVpicXRFbi1za1p0WHhFWDJUNmlHbUlvM3NXTXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNQWRpTmxVM3gwY3prXzZQOXhvbzdBS0JwbHlXUjY1d0hjNnRZRTJpZ1VYek11cFBkRGktUkktUUE1NkJlcklOeDlCdUY0NEtTanJTaDNSeUxWT1UyS0VOa1h4VnQ5Q3ZHVXBCYlRiRU5TYi1WZ2RDSzZ5ejRZbFk0VEZIbXRnYlNaR1RneTBGd2NzRWJyb1ZrSkQya250cWc0TWx4Z282dlo3RVh2RF9sX1JLd29wSFdxc1RFNkJMVDhwWGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Security News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQS0FuV1N3ZmNadmRCd0lyX3o3N1BaLWFFN0puY1o3TDA2ZnduSThNa2JDX2N0NDg2NUt2Z1JDdldvUnpTdy1ReENlTDZCUWdGbWw5U1ZCQlBCU09yNHd3dVV3Z0RneUIwQllXTGJxclJyWTE0elRUbm0zeXFiSThiSFhGcUJDaEJycU9RMkVVQndOQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE83S1BYT0d4akJiRXBMSmNFbWZBY2drQkIxQmJFT3A1T1ZDdEhSOTFNbE1XR3cxcHBDeTF4SFZ5ZFpHV3kteFQ0ajBPb25BX0JrM2dmTDU4ZXJIM